Z||000002||JohnF||11-14-2001||07:24 AM||||As for "going around the track", that is the great final day (of 2) event of the Good Guys Car Show held each mid-October in Ft. Worth, Texas at the Texas Motor Speedway.<P>Good speeds on the banked oval and photo ops galore! All entrants get to go around and around!<P>Anybody for the event there?  We can have our own class, I believe.  I don't think there is one now.||||reg||10
